  "notes": "Electron-style desktop music player (window controls in top bar). Track rows are rendered as individual rounded (12px) white cards with 2px light borders separated by gaps on a #f6f6f6 canvas rather than ruled table rows. Dark warm-brown (#2c1513) is the primary tint for icons, play button and active controls with light grey circular icon buttons; audio quality badges (Lossless/Hi-Res amber, HQ/SQ grey outline) are a distinctive touch. Playback progress is a thin brown line at the top edge of the player bar. Floating locate-current-track circle button at bottom right of list. List ends with '没有更多了 ~'."
